          ❰❰ Blocking ❱❱
          This guard rejects text containing "nosemgrep" but Semgrep also honours the short form "nosem". A 
          patch that adds "# nosem" passes this check and silences the scanner. Match the regex nosem(grep)?
          or compare findings with --disable-nosem.                                                         
                                                                                                            
